language ESSENCE' 1.0

given p_ExplicitR3_Explicit: matrix indexed by [int(1..2), int(1)] of int(1..3)
find a_ExplicitR3_Explicit: matrix indexed by [int(1..2), int(1)] of int(1..3)
branching on [a_ExplicitR3_Explicit]
such that
    and([a_ExplicitR3_Explicit[q7, 1] = p_ExplicitR3_Explicit[q7, 1] | q7 : int(1..2)]),
    -a_ExplicitR3_Explicit[1, 1] < -a_ExplicitR3_Explicit[2, 1]

